From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: soaresden <soaresden@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 23:54:03 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 10/15] window: answer SetBackgroundColor

A client command left unanswered keeps the client waiting forever.
Mophun games (Carmageddon 3D on the N-Gage) set the background colour
right after loading the Mophun engine and stayed on a black screen.
---
 src/emu/services/src/window/window.cpp | 6 ++++++
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/emu/services/src/window/window.cpp b/src/emu/services/src/window/window.cpp
index 206a2643c..98766fd13 100644
--- a/src/emu/services/src/window/window.cpp
+++ b/src/emu/services/src/window/window.cpp
@@ -1359,6 +1359,12 @@ namespace eka2l1::epoc {
             ctx.complete(epoc::error_none);
             break;
 
+        case ws_cl_op_set_background_color:
+            // The window server draws no background behind the windows: nothing to change,
+            // but the client waits for the answer
+            ctx.complete(epoc::error_none);
+            break;
+
         case ws_cl_op_get_double_click_settings:
             get_double_click_settings(ctx, cmd);
             break;
